
 >> x := Ahanoa hou.
 >> y := Ahanoa hou.
 >> z := x.
 Huaputa tuhi: ( x ōrite-pū: y ), rārangi-hou.
 Huaputa tuhi: ( x ōrite-pū: z ), rārangi-hou.
 Huaputa tuhi: ( x = y ), rārangi-hou.
 Huaputa tuhi: ( x = z ), rārangi-hou.
 Huaputa tuhi: ( x ≠ y ), rārangi-hou.
 Huaputa tuhi: ( x ≠ z ), rārangi-hou.
 